                <head>Boundary dispute: Ecuador and Peru</head>
                <p>[For protocol between Ecuador and Peru regarding peace, friendship, and
                    boundaries (signed also by representatives of the United States, Argentina,
                    Brazil, and Chile) signed at Rio de Janeiro, January 29, 1942, see Department of
                    State Executive Agreement Series No. 288, or 56 Stat. (pt. 2) 1818.
                    Documentation for 1947 is not published.]</p>
